## 10. Anti-flake

**Standard:** CI-only retries (`process.env.CI ? 2 : 0`); isolation via `fullyParallel`, unique data, and `trackProgram`; `page.clock.install()` before navigation for timestamp assertions; pinned `locale: 'en-US'` / `timezoneId: 'UTC'`; never `workers: 1` or `retries > 2`.

✅ **Good** (from `playwright.config.ts` + advised clock pattern):

```typescript
// playwright.config.ts
fullyParallel: true,
retries: process.env.CI ? 2 : 0,
use: { locale: 'en-US', timezoneId: 'UTC', trace: 'on-first-retry' },

// spec — freeze before goto when asserting timestamp text
await page.clock.install({ time: new Date('2026-08-08T16:00:00.000Z') });
const programName = `Web Development 2026 ${Date.now()}`;
```

❌ **Bad:**

```typescript
// playwright.config.ts
workers: 1,
retries: 5,

// spec
const programName = 'Web Development 2026';  // shared static name
await page.goto('/programs');                // wall-clock Date.now() already ran
```

**Why:** Serial runs and high retries mask real flakes; static data races under parallel workers; unpinned locale/timezone and wall-clock timestamps differ between local machine and CI.

---

## Do / Don't quick reference

| Do | Don't |
|---|---|
| `getByRole` / `getByLabel` in POM constructors | CSS, XPath, or inline locators in specs |
| `expect(locator).toBeVisible()` / `.toHaveText()` | `waitForTimeout`, `await locator.isVisible()` snapshots |
| Actions in POMs; assertions in specs | `expect(...)` inside `pages/` |
| Rely on `storageState` from `setup` project | UI login in every feature test |
| `uniqueName()` + `trackProgram(uuid)` | Static names; `@playwright/test` import when creating data |
| `{ request }` for API contracts; fixture for cleanup | Hardcoded Bearer tokens; manual `afterAll` delete |
| Targeted `page.route('**/api/programs**')` + live copy | `**/*` routes; invented error/empty strings |
| Axe `.withTags(['wcag2a','wcag2aa'])` + keyboard test | `.disableRules()` to green a failing scan |
| Hard `expect` for AC; `expect.soft` for audits | Soft asserts on critical gates |
| `page.clock.install()` before timestamp asserts | Wall-clock `Date.now()` when asserting the value |
| `retries: 2` on CI only; `fullyParallel: true` | `workers: 1`; `retries > 2` |
